# SSH hosts to include in the Claude Sessions panel, one per line.
#
# Each must be reachable as `ssh <host>` with no password prompt (a key
# in the SSH agent, or 1Password's SSH agent, is enough -- BatchMode is
# used so a host needing a password is skipped rather than hanging the
# panel), and must have `claude` and `python3` on PATH in a login shell.
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# myserver.example.com
# homelab.local
